  "doc.title": "Why Batteries Just Can't Hold More Charge · An Interactive Essay",
  "doc.desc": "Starting from half-reactions, the Faraday constant and the Nernst equation, we work all the way through a cell's energy density, fast charging, thermal runaway, aging and cost, and end with the 2026 frontier: every step has a model you can push around.",
  "nav.back": "← Knowledge Index",
  "nav.lang": "Language",
